Repair | Help | ZARA United States ZARA PRE-OWNED REPAIR REPAIR Our professional repair service, available at select Zara stores and online, helps you keep your clothes in good condition. We work with a network of specialized seamstress and tailor shops to offer the best solution for your repairs. AT A ZARA STORE Visit one of our Zara stores with the items you want to repair. Our staff will answer all your questions and guide you through the repair request process. Please note that you must pay for the repair in-store. Once it has been completed, we will notify you so that you can pick it up. Remember, you will have to pick up your items at the same store where you requested the service. Check in the store locator if the store you are interested in offers the repair service. PICK UP POINT You can request an item repair through Zara.com. Just click on the Repair option under the Zara Pre-owned category. Using a form, you can select the garments and the type of repair you want. We will show you a list of available repairs for each type of item. Once your request has been processed, you will receive a QR code or shipping label via email so you can drop your items at your nearest delivery point. Once the repair is finished, we will send the items at the address that you provided. If the delivery cannot be made, the shipper will tell you where the package has been deposited. If you prefer, you can contact the shipping company directly and schedule a new delivery. Remember: The shipping costs are $ 9.99. Frequently Asked Questions WHAT REPAIR SERVICES DO YOU OFFER AND HOW MUCH DO THEY COST? You can consult the list of repairs and their costs for the different types of items in the section REPAIR SERVICE PRICES. HOW SHOULD I PACKAGE THE ITEMS I SEND OUT FOR REPAIR? Make sure the package fits the size of the item you are shipping and that it is properly protected. We encourage you to reuse packaging from previous... it can take up to 14 days to repair an item. WHAT ADDITIONAL COSTS DO I HAVE TO PAY FOR A REPAIR SERVICE? In addition to the price of the items you repair on Zara Repair, the additional fees you must pay are as follows: Transport fees: the shipping costs are $ 9.99. Sales tax is a fee applied to the purchase of goods and services in accordance with state and local government regulations. The amount can vary depending on the state in which the customer is located. CAN I CANCEL A REPAIR ORDER? You can only cancel your order if there is a mistake in the repair request or if you haven’t dropped off the order yet at the delivery point. If this is the case, please contact us so we can help manage the return. CAN I ADD A REPAIR TO A REQUEST I HAVE ALREADY MADE? This is not possible, but you can make a new request for another repair that you need. CAN I REQUEST A REPAIR IF IT IS NOT INCLUDED IN THE LIST? If you want to request a repair other than those offered, we suggest you contact us so we can review it. However, please note that some repairs may not be available. THE REPAIR MADE TO MY GARMENT IS NOT CORRECT, WHAT CAN I DO? We perform each repair in a personalized way. However, if you detect a mistake, we suggest you contact us. Give us the repair number which can be found in the confirmation email and we will review your case. MY REPAIR ORDER GOT LOST. WHAT SHOULD I DO? If you have not received your order, please contact us so we can review the issue. Can’t find what you’re looking for? Contact us Our professional repair service, available at select Zara stores and online, helps you keep your clothes in good condition.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
